  "solution": "1. 27 and 81, + and -\n\n(31 × 3) + (81 × 4) - (27 ÷ 9) = 126\n\n⇒ (__**31 × 3**__) + (__**81**____** × 4**__) - (__**27**____** ÷ 9**__) = 126\n\n⇒ __**93 + 324**__ - 3 = 126\n\n​⇒ __**417 - 3**__ = 126\n\n⇒ 414 ≠ 126\n\n2. 31 and 27, + and -\n\n(__**27 × 3**__) + (__**31 × 4**__) - (__**81 ÷ 9**__) = 126\n\n⇒ __**81 + 124**__ - 9 = 126\n\n⇒ __**205 - 9**__ = 126\n\n⇒ 196 ≠ 126\n\n3. 3 and 4, ÷ and +\n\n(__**31 × 4**__) - (__**27 × 3**__) ÷ (__**81 + 9**__) = 126\n\n⇒ 124 - __**81 **____**÷**____** 90**__ = 126\n\n⇒ __**124 - 0.9**__ = 126\n\n⇒ 123.1 ≠ 126\n\n4. 27 and 9, + and -\n\n(__**31 × 3**__) + (__**9 × 4**__) - (__**81 ÷ 27**__) = 126\n\n⇒ __**93 + 36**__ - 3 = 126\n\n⇒ __**129 - 3**__ = 126\n\n⇒ 126 = 126\n\nHence, '**27 and 9, + and -**' is the correct answer.",
